- deck-files.ts: Study auto-imports agent-written deck files from the vault's
  Flashcards/ folder (tsv/txt/md, optional '# course:' header, parseCardPaste),
  tracked by a localStorage registry so each file imports once
- Study: scan-on-mount + 'Nemesis added a new deck' banner
- electron boot mkdir now also creates Nemesis Library/Flashcards
- nemesis-study-decks skill: teaches the agent to write TSV deck files grounded
  in the conversation; SOUL says it can create notes AND decks via files, not chat
- Closes the loop: decks live in localStorage (agent can't reach) so the agent
  writes files and the app imports them — same pattern as notes
